{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用回溯逐步构造长度为 2n 的字符串，并用“已用左括号数”和“已用右括号数”描述当前状态。只要左括号未用完就能继续放“(”，只有右括号少于左括号时才能放“)”，因此搜索过程中不会产生无效前缀。动画以 n = 3 逐步展示每次选择和撤销，并依次收集全部 5 个有效组合。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>括号生成：回溯过程</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}h1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.head p{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.card{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:600}.formula{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.rule{flex:1;min-width:140px;padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px}.mono,.num{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.track{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:4px 0 8px}.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;background:#252526;border-radius:4px;text-align:center;transition:.35s}.cell .char{display:block;font:14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600;color:#8d8d8d}.cell .idx{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font:10px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.cell.active .char{color:#fff}.status{padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;font-size:12px}.status strong{color:#3794ff}.meters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}.meter{padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px}.meter-bar{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:3px;margin-top:6px}.meter-fill{height:100%;background:#3794ff;border-radius:3px;transition:width .35s}.choices{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.choice{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.choice.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.choice.off{text-decoration:line-through;color:#8d8d8d}.results{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.result{padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;transition:.35s}.result.found{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.timeline{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}.dot{height:3px;flex:1;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:3px}.dot.on{background:#3794ff}.legend{margin-top:8px;color:#8d8d8d;line-height:1.45;font-size:12px}.footer{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px}.footer strong{color:#3794ff}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"head\"><h1>括号生成：只走有效前缀</h1><p>示例 <span class=\"mono\">n = 3</span>。每次选择一个括号；走到长度 <span class=\"mono\">6</span> 时收集答案，然后回退到上一个分叉点。</p></section>\n<section class=\"card\"><h2>两条约束</h2><div class=\"formula\"><div class=\"rule\">放左括号：<span class=\"mono\">左 &lt; n</span><br>还有未使用的左括号即可。</div><div class=\"rule\">放右括号：<span class=\"mono\">右 &lt; 左</span><br>先有可匹配的左括号，前缀才有效。</div></div></section>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n<div>\n<section class=\"card\"><h2>当前构造路径</h2><div id=\"track\" class=\"track\"></div><div class=\"status\"><div>动作：<strong id=\"action\"></strong></div><div>当前前缀：<span id=\"prefix\" class=\"mono\"></span></div></div><div class=\"meters\"><div class=\"meter\">左括号：<span id=\"left\" class=\"num\"></span><div class=\"meter-bar\"><div id=\"leftBar\" class=\"meter-fill\"></div></div></div><div class=\"meter\">右括号：<span id=\"right\" class=\"num\"></span><div class=\"meter-bar\"><div id=\"rightBar\" class=\"meter-fill\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"choices\"><div id=\"openChoice\" class=\"choice\">可放 “(”</div><div id=\"closeChoice\" class=\"choice\">可放 “)”</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"footer\"><strong>复杂度观察：</strong>搜索只扩展有效前缀，不枚举全部 <span class=\"mono\">2⁶</span> 个字符串。输出本身有 <span class=\"mono\">Cₙ</span> 个组合；除答案存储外，递归路径最多占 <span class=\"mono\">O(n)</span> 空间。</section>\n</div>\n<aside class=\"card\"><h2>已收集的有效组合</h2><div id=\"results\" class=\"results\"></div><div id=\"timeline\" class=\"timeline\"></div><p class=\"legend\"><b>回退</b>不是删除答案，而是撤销路径末尾的一次选择，再尝试另一条合法分支。</p></aside>\n</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst answers=[],steps=[];const n=3;\nfunction record(p,a){steps.push({p,a,f:answers.length});}\nrecord('','从空串开始');\nfunction search(prefix,left,right){if(prefix.length===2*n){answers.push(prefix);record(prefix,'长度达到 6, 收集第 '+answers.length+' 个答案');return;}\n if(left<n){record(prefix+'(','左括号 '+left+' < 3, 选择左括号');search(prefix+'(',left+1,right);record(prefix,'撤销左括号, 回到此前前缀');}\n if(right<left){record(prefix+')','右括号 '+right+' < 左括号 '+left+', 选择右括号');search(prefix+')',left,right+1);record(prefix,'撤销右括号, 回到此前前缀');}}\nsearch('',0,0);record('','搜索完成: 已收集全部 5 个组合');\nconst track=document.getElementById('track');\nfor(let i=0;i<6;i++){const c=document.createElement('div');c.className='cell';c.innerHTML='<span class=\"char\">·</span><span class=\"idx\">位置 '+i+'</span>';track.appendChild(c)}\nconst results=document.getElementById('results');answers.forEach(x=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='result';d.textContent=x;results.appendChild(d)});\nconst timeline=document.getElementById('timeline');steps.forEach(()=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='dot';timeline.appendChild(d)});\nlet index=0;\nfunction render(){const s=steps[index],chars=[...s.p],l=chars.filter(x=>x==='(').length,r=chars.length-l;[...track.children].forEach((c,i)=>{c.classList.toggle('active',i<chars.length);c.querySelector('.char').textContent=chars[i]||'·'});document.getElementById('action').textContent=s.a;document.getElementById('prefix').textContent=s.p||'空串';document.getElementById('left').textContent=l+' / 3';document.getElementById('right').textContent=r+' / 3';document.getElementById('leftBar').style.width=(l/3*100)+'%';document.getElementById('rightBar').style.width=(r/3*100)+'%';const oc=document.getElementById('openChoice'),cc=document.getElementById('closeChoice');oc.className='choice '+(l<3?'on':'off');cc.className='choice '+(r<l?'on':'off');[...results.children].forEach((d,i)=>d.classList.toggle('found',i<s.f));[...timeline.children].forEach((d,i)=>d.classList.toggle('on',i===index));index=(index+1)%steps.length}\nrender();setInterval(render,1900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
